# Allowlist for `vercel deploy` (Checkpoint 7a). The CLI uploads this folder but ignores .gitignore, so without
# this file it would upload fixtures/raw (raw API captures), data-local (strangers' leagues, archives), reports and
# the caches. Everything is ignored except what the build needs; add a line here only for a file the build reads.
/*
!/src
!/public
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/next.config.ts
!/tsconfig.json
!/postcss.config.mjs
!/eslint.config.mjs
!/vercel.json
